; Anomaly Coop - placeable campfires (campfire_placeable.script of G.A.M.M.A.). Read after every coop_route*.ltx (coop_route.ltx
; explains the order), so it wins over the generated coop_route_gamma.ltx.
;
; The script stays host: its item use creates the campfire. A client's use is a wrapper in coop_mods_items (a coop_* handler, view): the
; stock checks the ground and fades, the authority of the level sets the campfire up. Gathering wood is a menu action of the players own inventory: it
; arms two time events of this script (allowing_chop_again, eat_xcvb). Host-only, the router removed them on a client, so the
; "Gather wood" entry never came back after the first chop and the dummy item was never eaten.

[route_pairs]
time_event@campfire_placeable = owner
